[5220]={["aftermath"]="MacDonnell passed the next work to the alchemists and explained that reagents would have to be placed directly into the cauldron.",["atomIDs"]={"5220:description:1-117","5220:description:122-238","5220:objective:1-107"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5220:completion:1-38","5220:completion:40-53","5220:completion:58-96","5220:completion:98-220","5220:completion:225-325","5220:completion:327-440"},["opening"]="The bottle now held a suitable portion of the second mixture. Its return would let the alchemists work out the reagents to counter this particular brew.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver the Dalson sample.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the filled bottle to MacDonnell.",["sourceHash"]="c6ed355cbe297d8b81606a86f733de1cfd1e184b962c2c0e6998ca4a1ac55dc3",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5222]={["aftermath"]="The key disappeared after releasing the panel, revealing churning poison and access for another sample.",["atomIDs"]={"5222:description:1-148","5222:description:151-227","5222:description:232-290","5222:description:293-431","5222:description:434-488","5222:description:493-509","5222:objective:1-149","5222:objective:152-265"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5222:completion:1-164","5222:completion:167-248","5222:completion:253-400"},["opening"]="Two cauldrons were accessible, but MacDonnell sought all four for a wider choice of sabotage. The next lord guarded a vessel close to Andorhal's eastern walls.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to open the Writhing Haunt cauldron.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} unlocked the third cauldron.",["sourceHash"]="83ce2256be51a90be2221c3d9deafa171c43bb4267ce11155e080faf51dd3c06",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5223]={["aftermath"]="MacDonnell counted three available cauldrons and turned attention toward the last western one, while Arbington prepared reagent guidance.",["atomIDs"]={"5223:description:1-179","5223:description:184-300","5223:objective:1-107"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5223:completion:1-36","5223:completion:38-108","5223:completion:110-246","5223:completion:251-412","5223:completion:414-501"},["opening"]="The fragile bottle held a sample from beneath the third cauldron's platform. MacDonnell needed it back before the counteragent work could cover this new vessel.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to carry the Haunt sample to camp.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the filled bottle.",["sourceHash"]="1a3e861893adbb351d708a22cf2d552ccf55bfc5b223f83912025df0a9036d02",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5225]={["aftermath"]="Soulwrath's key disintegrated at the lock, and the panel swung open over viscous toxins.",["atomIDs"]={"5225:description:1-83","5225:description:86-175","5225:description:178-213","5225:description:218-383","5225:description:386-441","5225:description:444-499","5225:objective:1-150","5225:objective:153-271"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5225:completion:1-126","5225:completion:129-264","5225:completion:269-416"},["opening"]="The final cauldron stood near the eastern border under tougher ghostly guards. MacDonnell supplied the bottle and warned that the wraiths demanded particular care.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gain access at Gahrron's farm.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} opened the final cauldron.",["sourceHash"]="e6b5a8087098a6f1edd9b01c6d7cf422c44166ffa436ca1163b0da05ee87846d",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5226]={["aftermath"]="MacDonnell confirmed all four cauldrons were unlocked and expected Arbington's analysis to complete the reagent guidance.",["atomIDs"]={"5226:description:1-118","5226:description:123-239","5226:objective:1-112"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5226:completion:1-61","5226:completion:63-163","5226:completion:168-283","5226:completion:285-368","5226:completion:370-385"},["opening"]="The fourth sample was secured with the spigot closed behind it. Returning the poison would complete access work across the western cauldrons, though the mixtures still needed their separate reagents.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to deliver the final sample to MacDonnell.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the filled bottle to Chillwind.",["sourceHash"]="0c2b29e3227dddd9cc054857c4bcbdd6a296a175d682521e83c2b8d547f90454",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5228]={["aftermath"]="Vandis explained that access to all four western vessels was needed before their compositions could be subverted.",["atomIDs"]={"5228:description:1-114","5228:description:117-218","5228:description:223-377","5228:description:380-493","5228:objective:1-71"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5228:completion:1-50","5228:completion:52-134","5228:completion:139-272","5228:completion:274-398","5228:completion:403-473"},["opening"]="Derrington described cauldrons as engines of plague rather than targets that could simply be shut down. Vandis would coordinate a plan to alter their poisons against the Scourge.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to hear Vandis's briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} consulted the shadow priestess.",["sourceHash"]="01f804268a64466d600885d410552b046f9de69bd5692bbc76b8d1af025f097d",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5229]={["aftermath"]="Bilemaw's key disappeared after fitting the lock, leaving the panel accessible and a spigot ready for the sample.",["atomIDs"]={"5229:description:1-117","5229:description:120-209","5229:description:214-314","5229:description:317-371","5229:description:374-500","5229:objective:1-97","5229:objective:100-156","5229:objective:159-272"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5229:completion:1-127","5229:completion:130-187","5229:completion:190-305","5229:completion:310-451"},["opening"]="Vandis selected Felstone's less experienced guards as the first opportunity. The lord's key would open the panel so a bottle could collect toxin for study.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to open Felstone's cauldron for Vandis.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} gained access to the first vessel.",["sourceHash"]="af536fde7e791b69a4357dbe506dd3622d498cce4e4401c61560ad76a5127be3",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5230]={["aftermath"]="Vandis warned that a lasting advantage required continued reagent additions, not merely one altered batch.",["atomIDs"]={"5230:description:1-107","5230:description:112-223","5230:objective:1-102"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5230:completion:1-138","5230:completion:140-249","5230:completion:254-384","5230:completion:386-488"},["opening"]="The first bottle held enough poison for analysis at the Bulwark. Vandis awaited the sample that could begin Dithers's work on a counteragent.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to return the Felstone sample.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the filled bottle to Vandis.",["sourceHash"]="ddb390e43c5be5b2553b59f4c6c0f1a3255bcd651d0e8ed9f54deb87f9e7f5f9",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5231]={["aftermath"]="The skeletal key vanished in the lock, granting continued access to the tubes and sample spigot.",["atomIDs"]={"5231:description:1-108","5231:description:111-200","5231:description:205-294","5231:description:297-383","5231:description:386-504","5231:objective:1-145","5231:objective:148-261"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5231:completion:1-130","5231:completion:132-218","5231:completion:223-364"},["opening"]="The next field held a different toxic brew and required its own study. Vandis sent a new bottle north of Andorhal, expecting the lord to hold another access key.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to unlock Dalson's cauldron.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} opened the second vessel for the Horde inquiry.",["sourceHash"]="7f0b512fb0a4f7cb163e9dcaf7d7df7341b5a6d8dab1865945a8d4bf62e9bcbf",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5232]={["aftermath"]="Vandis said Dithers would provide the reagent list and that those materials had to enter the cauldron directly.",["atomIDs"]={"5232:description:1-117","5232:description:122-233","5232:objective:1-102"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5232:completion:1-38","5232:completion:40-53","5232:completion:58-96","5232:completion:98-220","5232:completion:225-325","5232:completion:327-430"},["opening"]="The second mixture was enclosed in its bottle. Study could now move from opening the vessel to choosing substances that would counter its particular toxins.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to carry the Dalson sample to the Bulwark.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the sample to Vandis.",["sourceHash"]="29bc8dffb7ad9876e6b81812025da25d4b7c3aa6d94c5f5668cc10bfd8c89358",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
