[5241]={["aftermath"]="Carlin learned his niece remained as a spirit and grieved that fortune had left him alive instead.",["atomIDs"]={"5241:description:1-66","5241:description:69-110","5241:description:115-144","5241:description:147-198","5241:description:203-290","5241:description:292-335","5241:description:338-359","5241:objective:1-20"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5241:completion:1-19","5241:completion:21-32","5241:completion:37-47","5241:completion:53-63","5241:completion:65-112","5241:completion:114-164","5241:completion:166-257","5241:completion:262-298","5241:completion:300-313","5241:completion:315-365"},["opening"]="Pamela heard what she thought was her uncle crying far to the east. She wanted him told that she was waiting and hoped for the familiar story of rabbits and berry jam.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to find Carlin and carry Pamela's message.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered news of Pamela.",["sourceHash"]="17e5499c9cec73a2250cae7e87e926771de61d0d35043c46a36f67054b7e76ed",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5242]={["aftermath"]="Greta judged the damage to the hierarchy a serious obstacle to the Council rebuilding its former power.",["atomIDs"]={"5242:description:1-85","5242:description:87-171","5242:description:173-227","5242:description:229-268","5242:description:270-291","5242:description:293-312","5242:description:314-352","5242:description:354-383","5242:description:385-440","5242:description:442-489","5242:description:491-509","5242:objective:1-88"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5242:completion:1-27","5242:completion:29-38","5242:completion:40-67","5242:completion:72-197","5242:completion:199-235"},["opening"]="The brief vision had named Fel'dan as the Council's mortal leader. With no hidden route or teleport, Greta saw a direct descent and attack on him and two servants as the remaining course.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Fel'dan's head after confronting his servants.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the final strike and returned to Greta.",["sourceHash"]="8440db7c1ff665709e1057502784f77809bf24a12660fe09b0c3066034a7f777",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5243]={["aftermath"]="Leonid praised both the tolerance and the resolve he saw in the service.",["atomIDs"]={"5243:description:1-37","5243:description:39-138","5243:description:140-219","5243:description:224-329","5243:description:334-408","5243:description:413-472","5243:description:474-498","5243:objective:1-35","5243:objective:37-118","5243:objective:120-212"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5243:completion:1-14","5243:completion:16-132"},["opening"]="Leonid regarded undeath as an illness he could turn against the Scourge. He asked for the Argent Dawn's surplus holy water, still stored among the supply crates of Stratholme.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover five portions of holy water for Leonid.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned five portions of Stratholme Holy Water to Leonid.",["sourceHash"]="c7043eaae40131edf2d50bebcf53d4ae5086c0e2df56956d39274c6750e03ae6",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5244]={["aftermath"]="Jaron distinguished his firsthand observations from a historian's expertise.",["atomIDs"]={"5244:description:1-117","5244:description:122-277","5244:description:279-384","5244:description:389-501","5244:objective:1-49"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5244:completion:1-49","5244:completion:51-125"},["opening"]="Wynd recounted an attempted theft of arcane power that shattered a relic beneath the ice. Jaron's recent visit could add observations to the history of the cursed ruins.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to ask Jaron about Kel'Theril.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the recent witness.",["sourceHash"]="c1389a605aebd8d8cebf3a1d45e431f210c69a2a4fff36b2259a9df8b03ed144",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5245]={["aftermath"]="Aurora initially resisted discussion of a painful past she believed could not be repaired.",["atomIDs"]={"5245:description:1-63","5245:description:65-181","5245:description:186-311","5245:description:316-403","5245:description:405-502","5245:objective:1-60","5245:objective:62-115"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5245:completion:1-74","5245:completion:76-131","5245:completion:133-178"},["opening"]="The spirits still sought pieces of the relic that had cursed them. Jaron's pick could recover them from the ice, but their interpretation belonged to Aurora far across the sea.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather four fragments for Aurora.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the relic fragments.",["sourceHash"]="1e8f221d094c1d5bbc52ae5f85048b5f2d355030414d1a094ad6b716ffb67c04",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5246]={["aftermath"]="The pages appeared untouched for many years.",["atomIDs"]={"5246:description:1-20","5246:description:22-50","5246:description:55-175","5246:description:180-211","5246:description:216-321","5246:description:323-424","5246:description:429-511","5246:objective:1-157"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5246:completion:1-52"},["opening"]="Aurora identified the broken relic as a vessel for powerful arcane forces. She agreed to help after hearing the request, but first needed old writings she hoped survived in Azshara's temple.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover the Highborne writings.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the writings to Aurora.",["sourceHash"]="f5ae3939c948235a31f19bf0c8ae5582026624c743456f4cfeeb8ec6c8967d91",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5247]={["aftermath"]="Aurora believed they could fuse the pieces into what the relic had once been.",["atomIDs"]={"5247:description:1-84","5247:description:89-170","5247:description:172-223","5247:description:225-304","5247:description:306-386","5247:description:391-511","5247:objective:1-144"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5247:completion:1-58","5247:completion:60-92"},["opening"]="The writings offered Aurora a possible way to repair the fragments. Strongly magical materials and water from an unlikely Dire Maul pool were required while she studied the old knowledge.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather the enchanted metal, crystals and water.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Aurora with the three kinds of material.",["sourceHash"]="c23173d3440a5d9f52b2675a3bf8d390a39a7b3315c772149a054c21b66c6a60",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5248]={["atomIDs"]={"5248:description:1-45","5248:description:47-107","5248:description:109-254","5248:description:260-293","5248:description:298-358","5248:description:360-445","5248:description:447-499","5248:objective:1-116"},["opening"]="The repaired crystal eased Aurora's sorrow without answering whether her shattered people could reunite. She sent the relic back to a spirit at the lake who understood the wrong done there.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to seek a remorseful spirit at Kel'Theril.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the restored crystal to a Highborne spirit.",["sourceHash"]="dcaf5e75f76bdb08a37314309eac24296def905eff5ab3a55f554ca5b44e7efd",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5249]={["atomIDs"]={"5249:description:1-74","5249:description:76-142","5249:description:147-243","5249:description:245-284","5249:description:289-334","5249:description:336-416","5249:objective:1-70"},["opening"]="Ivy's work kept her in Felwood despite interest in Winterspring's ancient ruins. Wynd at Starfall knew the region and could guide another traveler into its secrets.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to meet Wynd at Starfall.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Ivy's contact.",["sourceHash"]="e65e515b65aebae61fc710b524258c5099a233fac0f61ad9cb8e7ba532986f44",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5250]={["atomIDs"]={"5250:description:1-77","5250:description:79-145","5250:description:150-257","5250:description:259-331","5250:description:336-381","5250:description:383-455","5250:description:460-501","5250:objective:1-62"},["opening"]="Daryn's studies kept her from Winterspring's ancient elven ruins. She directed a student toward Starfall and Wynd Nightchaser, whose knowledge might open that harsh region to further study.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find Starfall and speak with Wynd Nightchaser.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Starfall and spoke with Wynd Nightchaser.",["sourceHash"]="d7008cff97dd2e4469717baaa4d5bbb444e42a219a5c03885ba832fc76521639",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5251]={["aftermath"]="The duke celebrated the loss of years of Crusade intelligence and expected the damage to be felt in the weeks ahead.",["atomIDs"]={"5251:description:1-59","5251:description:61-98","5251:description:100-162","5251:description:164-227","5251:description:232-256","5251:description:261-397","5251:description:399-437","5251:description:439-487","5251:objective:1-71","5251:objective:73-118"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5251:completion:1-16","5251:completion:18-45","5251:completion:47-113"},["opening"]="Duke Nicholas condemned the Scarlet Crusade's zealotry and the innocents it had destroyed. Galford guarded its most valued records in Stratholme; the duke wanted both archivist and archive destroyed.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to defeat Galford and burn the Scarlet Archive.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported Galford's defeat and the burning of the archive.",["sourceHash"]="38924bf7a10d176e0059c8dc8893b2c168d557bb00dea788babfe9a68ffa492c",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5252]={["atomIDs"]={"5252:description:1-6","5252:description:8-21","5252:description:26-80","5252:description:85-159","5252:description:161-291","5252:description:296-318","5252:description:323-349","5252:objective:1-109"},["opening"]="The spirit recognized both the restored crystal and the error of the ancient act. Peace came from knowing it had been recovered, but its proper return still needed guidance from Wynd.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to ask Wynd where the crystal belonged.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the spirit's request to Wynd.",["sourceHash"]="b5ee54ee758659ac05b081633c9d0aa91fbf684ec3e13472d3b3fbfa958d4a21",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5253]={["aftermath"]="Fandral promised safekeeping and hoped the spirits that once guarded its fragments would rest.",["atomIDs"]={"5253:description:1-21","5253:description:26-119","5253:description:121-205","5253:description:210-293","5253:description:295-359","5253:description:361-464","5253:objective:1-77"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5253:completion:1-135","5253:completion:137-278","5253:completion:283-318","5253:completion:320-427"},["opening"]="The ruined temple could no longer receive the relic. Wynd instead chose a keeper strong enough to hold its power without repeating the earlier abuse.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to deliver the crystal to Fandral.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} placed it in the archdruid's care.",["sourceHash"]="1d66da1bdb86efea5fa5772ab8517c98dd98eceaee0c4a775f0409548c157c1f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5261]={["aftermath"]="Eagan confirmed that he needed a wolf hunter; the introduction itself did not complete that hunt.",["atomIDs"]={"5261:description:1-64","5261:description:67-151","5261:description:156-198","5261:description:201-247","5261:objective:1-29"},["bridge"]="More wolves were appearing around Northshire Valley. Willem knew that Eagan Peltskinner, beside the abbey, was looking for someone to hunt them.",["bridgeFrom"]=783,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"5261:completion:1-12","5261:completion:15-61","5261:completion:64-83"},["opening"]="More wolves were appearing around Northshire Valley. Willem knew that Eagan Peltskinner, beside the abbey, was looking for someone to hunt them.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Eagan Peltskinner.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Eagan beside the abbey.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="48d19bbebf86858024058aeae145db7f5f4f3cd35afb6dc74be61ddea597dd8f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5262]={["aftermath"]="The duke questioned whether the Crusade had served as an unwitting instrument of a greater evil.",["atomIDs"]={"5262:description:1-72","5262:description:74-174","5262:description:179-228","5262:description:230-307","5262:description:312-379","5262:description:381-445","5262:description:450-495","5262:objective:1-82"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5262:completion:1-35","5262:completion:37-109","5262:completion:111-161"},["opening"]="The Grand Crusader's demonic identity demanded proof. Balnazzar's severed head could carry the revelation out of Stratholme to Duke Nicholas, who needed to hear what lay behind the Crusade's leadership.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring Balnazzar's head to Duke Nicholas.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the dreadlord's head to Duke Nicholas.",["sourceHash"]="21aa4c94cf2f5fe118aec3091cec444d6910caf7c46cbbb483f464f0ca24f71b",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5263]={["aftermath"]="The duke recognized a new champion and granted an audience with Lord Maxwell.",["atomIDs"]={"5263:description:1-69","5263:description:71-104","5263:description:106-186","5263:description:191-250","5263:description:255-300","5263:description:302-351","5263:description:353-407","5263:objective:1-50","5263:objective:52-104"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5263:completion:1-70","5263:completion:72-139"},["opening"]="Duke Nicholas turned from the Crusade to Stratholme's ruler. He demanded Rivendare's head as proof that a champion could strike at the servant through whom Kel'Thuzad ruled the city.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to defeat Rivendare and return with his head.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Baron Rivendare's head to Duke Nicholas.",["sourceHash"]="ee56922230652df4f8bf3342ca86236a5d80e56c0fad7ba603f50131453c0138",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5264]={["atomIDs"]={"5264:description:1-48","5264:description:53-122","5264:description:127-192","5264:objective:1-32","5264:objective:34-57"},["opening"]="Zverenhoff described an audience rarely granted to outsiders. Maxwell wished to acknowledge service to the Dawn inside the chapel.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to meet Tyrosus in the church.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} received the audience with Tyrosus.",["sourceHash"]="080d258eee96d3773c7a39dcc5d56e7483a828d636b95617f46be514297209c0",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5265]={["atomIDs"]={"5265:description:1-54","5265:description:56-153","5265:description:158-196","5265:objective:1-43"},["opening"]="Tyrosus opened a hold kept locked through the years. The granted access allowed its contents to be claimed as an acknowledgment of service.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to open the Argent hold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} opened the hold.",["sourceHash"]="81d6117aee47dd7049cc481025644e956f93e3af4fc20879bfd8ca20f8db5a6d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5281]={["atomIDs"]={"5281:description:1-63","5281:description:65-201","5281:description:206-265","5281:description:270-290","5281:description:295-382","5281:description:384-396","5281:description:398-472","5281:objective:1-10","5281:objective:12-65"},["opening"]="Alen remembered Stratholme's people who died in the fires rather than join the Scourge. Their restless spirits still walked the streets, and Egan's experiments might offer aid.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to find Egan near Stratholme.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Alen's associate.",["sourceHash"]="b04dca61a97fc7308eee4e8214f44a0c9fa71ab0a118143ffd40709f3beb9124",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5282]={["aftermath"]="Egan asked whether his mother had been among those freed. The question remained his, even as he praised the decency of the work.",["atomIDs"]={"5282:description:1-140","5282:description:142-166","5282:description:168-298","5282:description:303-338","5282:description:340-390","5282:description:395-448","5282:description:450-466","5282:objective:1-70","5282:objective:72-180","5282:objective:185-226"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5282:completion:1-33","5282:completion:38-63","5282:completion:65-81","5282:completion:86-122","5282:completion:124-143"},["opening"]="Egan's hatred of the Scourge did not extend to its innocent victims. His blaster could first break the citizens' ghostly shells, then free the restless souls trapped inside.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to use Egan's blaster twice to free fifteen souls.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the release of fifteen restless souls to Egan.",["sourceHash"]="1058cd61857a30c1747395182004366f46cfc9062481c4d3efeeca549c628d38",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5283]={["aftermath"]="Grumnus emphasized that this was the final chance to reconsider the choice of specialization.",["atomIDs"]={"5283:description:1-30","5283:description:35-89","5283:description:91-165","5283:description:170-218","5283:description:220-277","5283:description:282-309","5283:description:311-370","5283:description:372-458","5283:description:460-507","5283:objective:1-164"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5283:completion:1-15","5283:completion:17-60","5283:completion:62-118","5283:completion:123-160"},["opening"]="Grumnus believed defense decided great wars. Before teaching armor specialization, he demanded ornate mithril work that would show the skill he expected to shape.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to forge four helms, two pairs of boots, and a breastplate for Grumnus.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the required ornate mithril armor to Grumnus.",["sourceHash"]="fae08422722e04bca4fdd490c1d48814f90bb3603d98423d4365e68cd0ce0ad8",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5284]={["aftermath"]="Ironus said customers were waiting and prepared to begin the next stage of instruction.",["atomIDs"]={"5284:description:1-109","5284:description:111-219","5284:description:224-279","5284:description:284-493","5284:description:495-506","5284:objective:1-176"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5284:completion:1-11","5284:completion:13-39","5284:completion:44-77","5284:completion:79-146"},["opening"]="Ironus promised a busy trade supplying weapons to adventurers. First he wanted a selection of swords, axes, and maces as evidence that the aspiring smith could meet that demand.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to forge Ironus's requested twelve weapons.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered four broadswords, six axes, and two maces to Ironus.",["sourceHash"]="76e12db1752eaa20efa1d553939c65b7b7f92098024dc334739bab31bfee0798",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5301]={["aftermath"]="Okothos marked the delivery as the last step before the new career and the final moment to reconsider.",["atomIDs"]={"5301:description:1-13","5301:description:15-62","5301:description:64-154","5301:description:156-204","5301:description:209-276","5301:description:278-350","5301:description:355-471","5301:objective:1-164"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5301:completion:1-77","5301:completion:79-139","5301:completion:141-192"},["opening"]="Okothos found his satisfaction in seeing Horde warriors protected by steel he had forged. He offered a path into that craft after a demonstration in ornate mithril.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to make Okothos four helms, two pairs of boots, and a breastplate.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Okothos with the requested ornate mithril pieces.",["sourceHash"]="8a97ba4de1684908bd49d886eff592aaa5aa429291dfe1d45a37c8e50a9527a8",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5302]={["aftermath"]="Borgosh warned that the decision now stood at its final threshold before a life of further knowledge.",["atomIDs"]={"5302:description:1-42","5302:description:44-71","5302:description:76-100","5302:description:102-112","5302:description:114-195","5302:description:197-250","5302:description:255-298","5302:description:300-340","5302:objective:1-177"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5302:completion:1-77","5302:completion:79-139","5302:completion:141-187"},["opening"]="Borgosh's ambition was a legendary hammer fit for a Warchief. He offered to cultivate another smith's potential, beginning with a broad selection of forged weapons.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to make the broadswords, axes, and maces Borgosh required.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Borgosh the twelve weapons requested for training.",["sourceHash"]="1a7be8ad5f3c5e90d4f418b76e04d88820a6d7a4a9a884e7276920d94baee41d",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5305]={["aftermath"]="Lilith sent the smith onward with a fierce blessing for the work ahead.",["atomIDs"]={"5305:description:1-63","5305:description:65-120","5305:description:122-155","5305:description:157-249","5305:objective:1-54","5305:objective:56-116"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5305:completion:1-33"},["opening"]="The Crimson Hammersmith guarded a prized recipe in the Scarlet Bastion. Lilith offered knowledge of an enchanted battlehammer in return for his apron.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to defeat the Hammersmith and recover his apron.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the Crimson Hammersmith's Apron to Lilith.",["sourceHash"]="18f6b124ce66de444d721bff8bc0448ff1c5719bddd1418f1a569f968ea8a463",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5306]={["aftermath"]="Kilram affirmed the power of knowledge.",["atomIDs"]={"5306:description:1-34","5306:description:36-90","5306:description:95-134","5306:description:139-188","5306:description:193-232","5306:description:237-279","5306:description:281-326","5306:description:328-391","5306:objective:1-60","5306:objective:62-114"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5306:completion:1-19"},["opening"]="Kilram bore a facial scar from Vosh'gajin and sought vengeance against the shadow hunter in Blackrock Spire. Her snakestone was his price for sharing a weaponcrafting secret.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to defeat Vosh'gajin and take her snakestone to Kilram.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Vosh'gajin's Snakestone to Kilram.",["sourceHash"]="ddf54be104ce6a1e0c74b2a10a852803f2645426594cea853c758107ee0999e8",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5307]={["aftermath"]="Seril renewed his conviction that a sword was the finest choice of weapon.",["atomIDs"]={"5307:description:1-43","5307:description:45-180","5307:description:185-219","5307:description:224-284","5307:description:286-293","5307:description:298-408","5307:objective:1-62","5307:objective:64-135"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5307:completion:1-60"},["opening"]="Rivendare's Black Guard had stolen Seril's sword plans. The skeletal swordsmith who guarded them had to be destroyed, and his insignia would provide the proof Seril demanded.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to defeat the Black Guard Swordsmith and recover the insignia.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the Black Guard insignia to Seril.",["sourceHash"]="b12dd53c1cf74efea3ab5aa31c01e591a9af3e0143fafb52e394b02fe87c5ee2",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5321]={["atomIDs"]={"5321:description:1-110","5321:description:112-178","5321:description:183-188","5321:description:193-226","5321:description:228-306","5321:description:308-378","5321:description:383-459","5321:description:461-493","5321:objective:1-80"},["opening"]="Kerlonian had remained sleepy since awakening from the Emerald Dream. His interrupted journey led south to Liladris at Maestra's Post, and his horn might be needed if he fell asleep again along the dangerous road.",["pending"]="{actor} would escort Kerlonian to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Kerlonian Evershade's escort to Liladris Moonriver.",["sourceHash"]="b8e6baee3c232cdd6589d86f87a960d7171b5c044eae19f0427045e6c3951bfc",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5341]={["aftermath"]="Alexi welcomed the documents and turned his attention to securing the inheritance.",["atomIDs"]={"5341:description:1-53","5341:description:55-128","5341:description:130-162","5341:description:167-269","5341:description:274-348","5341:description:350-446","5341:objective:1-64","5341:objective:66-194","5341:objective:196-251"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5341:completion:1-19","5341:completion:21-51"},["opening"]="Alexi and Weldon were the last Barov heirs, and each sought the deeds in Scholomance. Alexi wanted the documents recovered before his human brother could claim the family fortune.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the deeds to Caer Darrow, Brill, Tarren Mill, and Southshore for Alexi.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the four Barov deeds to Alexi.",["sourceHash"]="7bb40fbb59e1f419467084ce83c1e5a74ef17ef04755102ed0cb2c553cb3cbb3",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5342]={["aftermath"]="Alexi declared the Barov fortune and power his alone.",["atomIDs"]={"5342:description:1-123","5342:description:125-139","5342:description:144-224","5342:description:229-330","5342:description:335-403","5342:description:405-430","5342:description:435-448","5342:description:453-468","5342:objective:1-77","5342:objective:79-118","5342:objective:123-189"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5342:completion:1-10","5342:completion:12-64","5342:completion:69-102","5342:completion:107-145"},["opening"]="Alexi's claim to the family fortune still faced his living brother. He demanded Weldon's head from Alliance protection at Chillwind as the condition for securing that inheritance.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Weldon's head to Alexi.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the head to Alexi.",["sourceHash"]="7edf16c4ea713030ec8319526654b1771bc29aebdffaa73b2498a2fcecfdfaae",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5343]={["aftermath"]="Weldon accepted the recovery and prepared to secure the inheritance.",["atomIDs"]={"5343:description:1-22","5343:description:24-59","5343:description:61-133","5343:description:138-152","5343:description:157-191","5343:description:193-218","5343:description:223-339","5343:description:341-381","5343:description:383-393","5343:objective:1-64","5343:objective:66-194","5343:objective:196-252"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5343:completion:1-19","5343:completion:21-51"},["opening"]="Weldon regretted sparing his undead brother and now feared losing the Barov inheritance to him. Four deeds in Scholomance could give Weldon the claim he wanted.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to retrieve the family's four deeds for Weldon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Weldon the deeds to Caer Darrow, Brill, Tarren Mill, and Southshore.",["sourceHash"]="fd78491ed03b29363c07e37069c6118c59325ebc249abee4fee1cf5ede608308",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5344]={["aftermath"]="Weldon regarded his fortune as secured by his brother's death.",["atomIDs"]={"5344:description:1-60","5344:description:62-82","5344:description:84-178","5344:description:183-201","5344:description:203-265","5344:description:270-339","5344:description:341-357","5344:description:359-387","5344:description:389-446","5344:objective:1-70","5344:objective:72-112","5344:objective:117-180"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5344:completion:1-21","5344:completion:23-92","5344:completion:97-134"},["opening"]="Weldon treated Alexi's survival as a threat to both inheritance and safety. His rival remained under Horde protection at the Bulwark, leaving the requested killing an intrusion into hostile territory.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover Alexi's head for Weldon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the head at Chillwind.",["sourceHash"]="ff1813a053700d4443cf393a34ca5ed9ccc6c3d40c422582ef1a10f55ba898b8",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5361]={["atomIDs"]={"5361:description:1-69","5361:description:71-92","5361:description:94-134","5361:description:136-259","5361:description:264-356","5361:description:358-455","5361:objective:1-89"},["opening"]="A year had passed since Longhorn last wrote to his brother. Unusual centaur activity gave this report a purpose beyond renewing family contact.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry the report to Nataka.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it at Ghost Walker Post.",["sourceHash"]="7e7efa764da673e26312628c76686cd72bc8f650a5212d8835654f1b65dbc3f7",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5381]={["aftermath"]="Taiga prepared to open the box and reveal the hand within it.",["atomIDs"]={"5381:description:1-42","5381:description:44-86","5381:description:88-155","5381:description:157-211","5381:description:216-310","5381:objective:1-131"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5381:completion:1-18","5381:completion:20-57","5381:completion:59-100"},["opening"]="Taiga identified a boxed demonic hand as the means opening portals at Mannoroc Coven. Her pick offered access through the red crystal in Thunder Axe Fortress.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to retrieve the box and return the pick.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the Demon Box and pick to Taiga.",["sourceHash"]="bc6580a2b6be2fa4ffb2c78314460ff2087efaf72111a3befcb07cda05d9e062",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5382]={["aftermath"]="Eva felt her spirit beginning to heal, but believed further work remained.",["atomIDs"]={"5382:description:1-53","5382:description:55-101","5382:description:106-185","5382:description:187-225","5382:description:227-249","5382:objective:1-53","5382:objective:55-140","5382:objective:142-190"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5382:completion:1-33","5382:completion:35-124"},["opening"]="Eva demanded justice for the thousands Krastinov had killed. After his destruction, the remains of Eva and Lucien were to be burned, releasing them from the place of their torment.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to defeat Krastinov and burn the Sarkhoffs' remains.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported Krastinov's destruction and the burning of Eva's and Lucien's remains.",["sourceHash"]="f5f5fa96c4d146c449303e5234a88aca28fad5217d30fe89c32845a949d1172e",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5384]={["aftermath"]="Eva declared one chapter of Scholomance's horror closed. She offered a portion of the Sarkhoffs' essence so other lost souls of Caer Darrow could be heard.",["atomIDs"]={"5384:description:1-15","5384:description:20-59","5384:description:64-86","5384:description:88-140","5384:description:145-196","5384:description:198-258","5384:description:263-290","5384:description:292-317","5384:description:319-356","5384:description:358-440","5384:description:445-507","5384:objective:1-54","5384:objective:56-118","5384:objective:120-162","5384:objective:167-203","5384:objective:205-248"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5384:completion:1-91","5384:completion:93-127","5384:completion:129-173","5384:completion:175-188","5384:completion:190-222","5384:completion:224-297"},["opening"]="The blood of innocents could draw Kirtonos to the Scholomance porch. Eva wanted the very offering used to appease him turned into the means of bringing about his destruction.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to summon Kirtonos at the brazier and defeat him.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Eva after summoning and defeating Kirtonos.",["sourceHash"]="0b083341a85d96b6e8f966efab9997347f87a4e0fcd74590a1a655b85a58bfc4",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5385]={["aftermath"]="Jessir honored both Arko's rescue and the effort made for her lost friend.",["atomIDs"]={"5385:description:1-122","5385:description:124-228","5385:objective:1-67"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5385:completion:1-15","5385:completion:17-73","5385:completion:75-126","5385:completion:128-279","5385:completion:284-337"},["opening"]="Trey's remains were ready to leave the fortress. The return to Jessir would place them with his friends and allow the respect still owed him.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to carry the remains to Jessir.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the paladin's remains.",["sourceHash"]="6c8b274ba071c4019854ccaf5c7b5c2dbfe2db47f93c7d3fbb3f662f91d80333",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5386]={["atomIDs"]={"5386:description:1-73","5386:description:75-139","5386:description:141-233","5386:description:235-240","5386:description:245-292","5386:description:294-381","5386:description:383-445","5386:objective:1-93"},["opening"]="Centaur activity kept Nataka from visiting Shadowprey's fishermen. He asked for Bloodbelly fish from Jinar'Zillen to restore a favorite meal at the post.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to obtain two fish for Nataka.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Bloodbelly fish to Nataka.",["sourceHash"]="c1ad6818c17f0536ea3825224cb38dc0f291776a5967d0c23b28dfa549b6e238",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5461]={["aftermath"]="Marduke had doubted any survived and welcomed the new possibility before warning of a far more dangerous next task.",["atomIDs"]={"5461:description:1-51","5461:description:53-181","5461:description:186-338","5461:description:343-442","5461:description:444-468","5461:objective:1-59","5461:objective:61-108","5461:objective:110-172"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5461:completion:1-55","5461:completion:57-133","5461:completion:138-231"},["opening"]="Marduke's method of restoring Ras to mortality required something from his living years. He feared an undead person might have destroyed every such reminder, making Stromgarde's ruins an uncertain search.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to seek a keepsake from Ras's human life.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned a keepsake to Marduke.",["sourceHash"]="8e97d3b385045ccefceeddec9227ef9c389d8f481ddb722ac9c58793a68177cf",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5462]={["aftermath"]="The object stirred memories Leonid had hoped to leave buried.",["atomIDs"]={"5462:description:1-48","5462:description:53-131","5462:description:133-233","5462:description:238-276","5462:description:281-399","5462:description:401-441","5462:description:443-459","5462:description:461-486","5462:objective:1-90","5462:objective:92-170"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5462:completion:1-33","5462:completion:38-108"},["opening"]="The keepsake needed attunement where Ras willingly surrendered his life. Marduke had only rumor placing that event in Stratholme and directed the inquiry to Leonid's knowledge.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to show the keepsake to Leonid.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it at Light's Hope.",["sourceHash"]="aa7cb4993ef0ceb9c31f64175898a6335a0078996cb0038595f7710e31def7dc",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5463]={["aftermath"]="The keepsake rested on the ground Leonid had identified.",["atomIDs"]={"5463:description:1-84","5463:description:86-160","5463:description:162-216","5463:description:218-320","5463:description:325-378","5463:description:383-402","5463:description:404-508","5463:objective:1-46","5463:objective:48-104"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5463:completion:1-43"},["opening"]="Leonid remembered the ground where Ras pledged his soul and rose as a lich. The place the Scourge held sacred was where the Keepsake of Remembrance now had to be laid.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to place the keepsake on the unholy ground in Stratholme.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} placed the Keepsake of Remembrance upon the tainted soil.",["sourceHash"]="5d6ea081217c5bdb038854cf2cf9ee6a18afcfd426785cc019d55d53d481a12e",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5464]={["aftermath"]="Leonid explained that the same clinging soul could now attach to Ras's physical form.",["atomIDs"]={"5464:description:1-121","5464:description:123-169","5464:objective:1-73"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5464:completion:1-94"},["opening"]="The fallen soul had clung to the reminder of its former life. The transformed keepsake was ready to carry back to Leonid for the next step against Ras.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to return the soulbound keepsake.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it to Leonid.",["sourceHash"]="5f41b3e3a0933dfb4c499d7c8e1fd265b5d95efeb9db7fa091f9cda38a369621",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5465]={["aftermath"]="Marduke admitted that he had expected another spirit rather than a living return.",["atomIDs"]={"5465:description:1-40","5465:description:42-73","5465:objective:1-44","5465:objective:46-77"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5465:completion:1-69"},["opening"]="Leonid sent the attuned keepsake back across the Plaguelands. Marduke would provide the instructions for using its soulbound power.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to return the keepsake to Caer Darrow.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} showed the soulbound object to Marduke.",["sourceHash"]="9ed02777dbcc42b0515d53c510ca37bbc1c7508718cd3288036dae76bf231398",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5466]={["aftermath"]="Marduke hailed the result as a mortal blow against the Scourge and its masters.",["atomIDs"]={"5466:description:1-36","5466:description:38-86","5466:description:91-172","5466:description:175-248","5466:description:250-276","5466:description:281-338","5466:description:340-381","5466:description:383-422","5466:objective:1-41","5466:objective:43-115","5466:objective:117-228","5466:objective:230-270"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5466:completion:1-41","5466:completion:43-105"},["opening"]="Marduke's last task depended on making Ras mortal again. The Soulbound Keepsake would be used against the lich before his human head could be taken as proof.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to use the keepsake on Ras, defeat him as a mortal, and return his head.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the Human Head of Ras Frostwhisper to Marduke.",["sourceHash"]="8a9a6f1c34ee9953fa4da45f69e0f0cf0f0eb7995c30faef52c45b82174a5ed8",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5481]={["aftermath"]="Holland rejected the plants as the wrong kind and explained that he needed doom weed instead.",["atomIDs"]={"5481:description:1-18","5481:description:20-61","5481:description:63-94","5481:description:96-114","5481:description:116-152","5481:description:157-227","5481:objective:1-90"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5481:completion:1-12","5481:completion:14-25","5481:completion:27-54","5481:completion:56-186","5481:completion:188-198","5481:completion:203-257","5481:completion:259-376","5481:completion:378-387"},["opening"]="Gordo struggled to pick weeds with oversized hands. He enlisted help gathering gloom weed for Holland at Brill's graveyard.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gather three weeds and take them to Holland.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Gordo's requested weeds.",["sourceHash"]="adc17ab136e99d1f56952544eacfafd48c2ffd4954ed5628384dbbcc18d23936",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5482]={["atomIDs"]={"5482:description:1-47","5482:description:49-99","5482:description:101-152","5482:description:154-223","5482:description:228-346","5482:description:348-394","5482:objective:1-72"},["opening"]="Holland corrected the mistaken collection with a more precise request. The needed plants grew around the mass graves north of Brill's graveyard, among gnolls.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to collect ten of Holland's required weeds.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the doom weed to Holland.",["sourceHash"]="3579d906a3021378725832e580cb115a95a161f739350ba2703b809f826afe6c",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5501]={["atomIDs"]={"5501:description:1-58","5501:description:61-103","5501:description:105-195","5501:description:200-300","5501:description:303-419","5501:description:422-434","5501:objective:1-82"},["opening"]="Bibbly had customers turning kodo bones into furniture, instruments and blasting powder. The southern graveyard offered more stock for the caravan trade.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to collect ten kodo bones.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the bones to Bibbly.",["sourceHash"]="496d642a957817a19917074bbcbf7b0fc1aca4297641ddedcc0e4bb58ba8c45a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5502]={["aftermath"]="Battlewail named the child Grunth, thanked his guardian, and invited future visits for both their sakes.",["atomIDs"]={"5502:description:1-37","5502:description:40-104","5502:description:107-116","5502:description:119-229","5502:description:232-248","5502:description:250-263","5502:description:268-320","5502:description:323-392","5502:objective:1-135"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5502:completion:1-30","5502:completion:32-103","5502:completion:105-178","5502:completion:183-241","5502:completion:243-289"},["opening"]="The orphan's Children's Week visit was ending. He spoke of rising above loss as his parents had taught him and wanted to return to the matron with an account of the kindness he had received.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to return the orphan's whistle to Matron Battlewail.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the Orcish Orphan Whistle to the Orgrimmar orphanage.",["sourceHash"]="085f0bd8627e501ea40ff3c63c4082cf69b49cbe0489e4ec08b20693955b341e",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5504]={["aftermath"]="Hasana opened mantle purchases through authorized quartermasters while the required standing was maintained.",["atomIDs"]={"5504:description:1-55","5504:description:58-90","5504:description:93-220","5504:description:225-362","5504:description:365-499","5504:objective:1-94"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5504:completion:1-57","5504:completion:59-147","5504:completion:149-288","5504:completion:293-327"},["opening"]="Hasana offered access to the Dawn's resistance mantles in recognition of revered standing. Ten valor tokens were required as a further tribute, with five different protections available for shoulder armor.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to give Hasana ten valor tokens.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the tribute at the Bulwark.",["sourceHash"]="5e51a723c953dcfeaee36a1a436582c732f2256ee0b468f33575f5cd0e74bb60",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5507]={["aftermath"]="Lightspark confirmed purchase access while the present standing with the Dawn endured.",["atomIDs"]={"5507:description:1-55","5507:description:58-90","5507:description:93-220","5507:description:225-362","5507:description:365-499","5507:objective:1-101"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5507:completion:1-57","5507:completion:59-147","5507:completion:149-288","5507:completion:293-327"},["opening"]="Lightspark's offer placed five forms of magical protection within reach of revered members. A ten-token tribute would unlock purchases rather than automatically apply an enchantment.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to offer ten tokens to Lightspark.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the tribute at Chillwind.",["sourceHash"]="525831a6cf95c29a2016ff769d333dd786fbc27d1b50ec989cb400b9a2f138b7",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5513]={["aftermath"]="The quartermaster confirmed that purchases depended on maintaining the required standing.",["atomIDs"]={"5513:description:1-55","5513:description:58-90","5513:description:93-220","5513:description:225-362","5513:description:365-499","5513:objective:1-106"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5513:completion:1-57","5513:completion:59-147","5513:completion:149-288","5513:completion:293-327"},["opening"]="Breechlock offered revered servants a choice of resistance mantles for their shoulder armor. Ten tokens would establish purchase access across the Dawn's authorized quartermasters.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to offer Breechlock ten tokens.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the valor tribute.",["sourceHash"]="1550e5407e8b624b42efec2e38f52f34d16b2c667bf7320768f9d8abb814fa2a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5514]={["aftermath"]="Goodsteel accepted the bargain and prepared to pack the already-imbued fragments into the mold.",["atomIDs"]={"5514:description:1-60","5514:description:63-146","5514:description:149-245","5514:description:248-317","5514:description:322-353","5514:description:356-412","5514:description:417-461","5514:description:464-468","5514:description:473-493","5514:description:496-505","5514:objective:1-88"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5514:completion:1-59","5514:completion:61-126","5514:completion:131-161","5514:completion:163-174","5514:completion:176-245"},["opening"]="Dithers named Goodsteel as the likely mold-maker and left the fee to the courier. The tempered bone fragments had to travel with fifteen gold to Gadgetzan.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the fragments and fee to Goodsteel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered both in Tanaris.",["sourceHash"]="0bd9f111ce0f9398f785e1ab4316560d922f397b954a9b25d4b4f1ddc4c97312",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5515]={["aftermath"]="Eva immediately recognized the bag.",["atomIDs"]={"5515:description:1-86","5515:description:88-129","5515:description:134-226","5515:description:231-319","5515:description:324-391","5515:description:393-431","5515:objective:1-56","5515:objective:58-108","5515:objective:110-140"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5515:completion:1-19"},["opening"]="Eva's relief after Krastinov's death did not end the task. Jandice Barov was said to carry the victims' blood to Kirtonos; her bag might reveal how to summon his master.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to defeat Jandice and bring her bag to Eva.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} recovered Krastinov's Bag of Horrors and returned it to Eva.",["sourceHash"]="816e1075d7e3f8f5a4d0f2be719730af45662ace09a2c60b96730c3f18c21b00",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5517]={["aftermath"]="Additional purchases became available while exalted standing with the Dawn endured.",["atomIDs"]={"5517:description:1-110","5517:description:113-285","5517:description:288-374","5517:description:379-485","5517:objective:1-106"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5517:completion:1-68","5517:completion:73-191","5517:completion:193-277"},["opening"]="The chapel's quartermaster offered the chromatic protection reserved for the Dawn's highest standing. Twenty-five tokens were the tribute requested for the mantle covering all resistible magic.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to give Breechlock twenty-five tokens.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the chromatic tribute.",["sourceHash"]="35657713f7faabf9674b90f457476b324eb99f9e5e3c486ca5c293b6123f13f7",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5518]={["aftermath"]="Knot fashioned the disguise and warned that it would last ten minutes and deceive Kromcrush only about its wearer.",["atomIDs"]={"5518:description:1-148","5518:description:151-195","5518:description:198-240","5518:description:245-257","5518:description:260-373","5518:description:376-424","5518:description:427-470","5518:description:473-497","5518:objective:1-98","5518:objective:101-160"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5518:completion:1-29","5518:completion:32-65","5518:completion:67-108","5518:completion:111-163","5518:completion:168-195","5518:completion:198-264","5518:completion:267-362","5518:completion:365-422","5518:completion:424-495"},["opening"]="Chained in Dire Maul, Knot proposed a disguise to get past Kromcrush without killing him. Runecloth, leather, thread, and ogre tannin could make a suit stable for only a short time.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to supply Knot with the materials for the ogre suit.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the cloth, leather, thread, and tannin to Knot.",["sourceHash"]="060b8f2cac227c95b0d34550850ba8df9b632a0ce29e18204ffa2d793de80ced",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5521]={["aftermath"]="Further purchases became available through the Dawn's quartermasters while exalted standing was maintained.",["atomIDs"]={"5521:description:1-110","5521:description:113-285","5521:description:288-374","5521:description:379-485","5521:objective:1-101"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5521:completion:1-68","5521:completion:73-191","5521:completion:193-277"},["opening"]="Lightspark reserved the chromatic version for the Dawn's greatest standing. Its protection covered all resistible magic together, in exchange for twenty-five tokens of tribute.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring Lightspark twenty-five tokens.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the chromatic tribute.",["sourceHash"]="25bc3c6ec26637b17b96e26c8d4b56232e8f146ea2dbc249d0a5bda6d0388d74",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5522]={["aftermath"]="Leonid revealed his deception of Tinkee and his Argent Dawn allegiance, explaining that the eggs had been diverted from an enemy.",["atomIDs"]={"5522:description:1-44","5522:description:47-137","5522:description:140-230","5522:description:235-275","5522:description:278-367","5522:description:372-382","5522:description:385-392","5522:description:395-418","5522:description:421-437","5522:description:439-510","5522:objective:1-71"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5522:completion:1-14","5522:completion:16-105","5522:completion:107-151","5522:completion:153-234","5522:completion:239-298","5522:completion:300-459"},["opening"]="A message in Vectus's name redirected the frozen eggs to Leonid. Tinkee did not know the intermediary and resented being passed over for delivery.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the eggs to Light's Hope.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the frozen eggs to Leonid.",["sourceHash"]="a36dac7838191ec751ba0e3fec1307791f3332c7dac23e4a3fb4d334d70a697a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5524]={["aftermath"]="Hasana confirmed access to additional chromatic mantles so long as exalted standing continued.",["atomIDs"]={"5524:description:1-110","5524:description:113-285","5524:description:288-374","5524:description:379-485","5524:objective:1-94"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5524:completion:1-68","5524:completion:73-191","5524:completion:193-277"},["opening"]="Hasana offered the broader mantle whose protection combined all forms of resistible magic. The tribute required twenty-five tokens as a sign of service worthy of the special item.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to give Hasana the twenty-five tokens.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the required tribute.",["sourceHash"]="6014bf35bc446986ce50fbcc207da1b505bb3ffa0d56b2b12a4f2dd85370f80a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5526]={["aftermath"]="Rabine counted the sealed Felvine as a victory for the Cenarion Circle. He explicitly regarded the larger war as unfinished.",["atomIDs"]={"5526:description:1-84","5526:description:87-189","5526:description:192-259","5526:description:264-343","5526:description:346-408","5526:description:411-455","5526:description:460-491","5526:objective:1-58","5526:objective:61-148","5526:objective:151-270"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5526:completion:1-72","5526:completion:74-179","5526:completion:184-241","5526:completion:243-331","5526:completion:333-342"},["opening"]="Rabine directed the secured reliquary toward eastern Dire Maul, where Alzzin's corruption had reached the former Fruit of Fertility. A shard of the Felvine needed to be captured and sealed before returning to Moonglade.",["pending"]="{actor} would acquire a Felvine shard and seal it in the Reliquary of Purity for Rabine.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the securely sealed Felvine shard to Rabine Saturna.",["sourceHash"]="888200ab6bc527aeda730a7e7df4299841d1c07fde182c7fb16bcff391cfe106",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5527]={["aftermath"]="Possession of the reliquary reassured Rabine that a dangerous substance could be brought back. It prepared the next undertaking against a demon rather than carrying out that undertaking itself.",["atomIDs"]={"5527:description:1-134","5527:description:137-264","5527:description:269-362","5527:description:365-406","5527:description:409-492","5527:objective:1-94","5527:objective:97-182"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5527:completion:1-45","5527:completion:47-110","5527:completion:115-176","5527:completion:178-311"},["opening"]="Rabine needed a container able to hold the Felvine without corrupting its handler. He remembered a Reliquary of Purity in the long-abandoned Southwind ruins and sent a search into Silithus.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover a Reliquary of Purity from Southwind Village.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the recovered Reliquary of Purity to Rabine Saturna.",["sourceHash"]="e9f47f46f52c902b959c15e48b9f1bb702fa2d5dd6c6a28bd062828747706cf2",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5529]={["aftermath"]="Betina hoped the loss would delay another clutch, though she could not be certain how long.",["atomIDs"]={"5529:description:1-94","5529:description:97-195","5529:description:200-300","5529:description:305-367","5529:description:369-395","5529:objective:1-88"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5529:completion:1-14","5529:completion:17-84","5529:completion:89-116"},["opening"]="The Argent Dawn had learned of plagued dragons bred at Scholomance. Betina feared what a Scourge dragonflight could do and wanted the hatchlings destroyed before they grew.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to defeat twenty plagued hatchlings at Scholomance.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the defeat of twenty plagued hatchlings to Betina.",["sourceHash"]="5095b72d5b6aff8675a8ef622789d9f64bcfd256292ac601e7a40ed5cb51f6f3",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5531]={["aftermath"]="Betina reserved the eggs for study and wanted their container for a device intended to destroy Scholomance's undead scholars. She admitted that the device remained untested.",["atomIDs"]={"5531:description:1-93","5531:description:96-222","5531:description:227-266","5531:description:271-320","5531:description:323-423","5531:description:426-472","5531:objective:1-43"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5531:completion:1-15","5531:completion:17-45","5531:completion:47-63","5531:completion:68-186","5531:completion:191-290","5531:completion:292-400","5531:completion:405-447","5531:completion:449-473","5531:completion:478-502"},["opening"]="Leonid identified the frozen eggs as valuable material for Scourge dragon experiments. He sent them to Betina, whose scientific work offered a way to strike against the research.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring the frozen eggs to Betina.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the frozen eggs to Betina.",["sourceHash"]="25c813874569856d6658c12d22a0bb812d33c6c920122bf23a975f3469961267",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5533]={["aftermath"]="Arbington believed he knew a means of acquiring the needed key.",["atomIDs"]={"5533:description:1-97","5533:description:100-188","5533:description:190-218","5533:description:221-304","5533:description:309-395","5533:description:398-466","5533:description:469-498","5533:objective:1-71"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5533:completion:1-13","5533:completion:16-148","5533:completion:150-191","5533:completion:196-259","5533:completion:262-313"},["opening"]="Valorfist suspected terrible acts behind Scholomance's locked entrance but acknowledged the limits of that knowledge. Arbington's study of the school offered a practical way to gain a key.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to consult Arbington about entry.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with the alchemist.",["sourceHash"]="70d4f2a8fb66f70f831ceec1e14f901a3537e00869e0effba4debcfed4282bcf",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5534]={["aftermath"]="He still needed to learn its purpose and why Rimtori wanted it.",["atomIDs"]={"5534:description:1-6","5534:description:8-13","5534:description:18-49","5534:description:51-94","5534:description:96-111","5534:description:113-126","5534:description:128-166","5534:description:168-303","5534:description:308-432","5534:description:434-481","5534:objective:1-116"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5534:completion:1-5","5534:completion:7-16","5534:completion:21-124","5534:completion:126-129","5534:completion:131-166","5534:completion:168-176","5534:completion:182-214","5534:completion:219-234","5534:completion:236-251","5534:completion:253-328"},["opening"]="Kim'jael's next interest lay in the treasure his former employers sought. A rune now held by naga might explain their plans and give him leverage against the woman who hired him.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover the rune from Eldarath.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the rune to Kim'jael.",["sourceHash"]="899c492717afb2387832dcdd9f575d121d74f72c84b649b55f3f26343d4dae37",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5535]={["aftermath"]="Loh'atu said the spirits were at peace and the threats drawn by their arcane desire had diminished.",["atomIDs"]={"5535:description:1-108","5535:description:110-235","5535:description:237-262","5535:description:267-363","5535:description:365-427","5535:description:432-496","5535:objective:1-97"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5535:completion:1-14","5535:completion:16-39","5535:completion:41-139","5535:completion:144-242"},["opening"]="Loh'atu had promised the Sentinels to release the shrine's spirits. He connected their lingering hunger for arcane power to the Highborne's troubled history and asked for help ending their bonds.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront the apparitions and lichlings.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Loh'atu's spirit assignment.",["sourceHash"]="9ec60890f15faffa2d2f1a16c24e0410fe2c0aa95840186bdc93ac2e107ec808",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5536]={["aftermath"]="Loh'atu interpreted the service as loyalty to the Earthmother's principles, whether or not the helper shared his faith.",["atomIDs"]={"5536:description:1-111","5536:description:113-323","5536:description:328-394","5536:description:399-447","5536:description:449-510","5536:objective:1-117"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5536:completion:1-14","5536:completion:16-57","5536:completion:59-200","5536:completion:202-248","5536:completion:250-334","5536:completion:339-416"},["opening"]="Loh'atu's oath committed him to aid the elves against the satyrs. The Haldarr presence northeast of his camp gave that promise an immediate target.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to confront the three Haldarr groups.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the satyr assignment.",["sourceHash"]="4599a82311824841d57675a75cb960992452cacd3d1ea811b9534eda7e090ad3",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5537]={["aftermath"]="Arbington prepared them for intense forging and pointed the next stage toward a Tanaris smith's mold.",["atomIDs"]={"5537:description:1-48","5537:description:51-188","5537:description:191-308","5537:description:313-343","5537:description:346-397","5537:description:400-498","5537:objective:1-91"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5537:completion:1-17","5537:completion:20-167","5537:completion:172-232","5537:completion:235-332","5537:completion:335-398"},["opening"]="Arbington's key design began with bone from several skeletons. Strong metal, a proper mold and a signet of power would follow, but the first collection could be made around Andorhal.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather fifteen bone fragments.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Arbington with the fragments.",["sourceHash"]="5c48a4671cddaac4ac5c69b9cd52c4dbd17e1b5d96bc8f884442728caadb2847",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5538]={["aftermath"]="Goodsteel began packing the tempered bones, satisfied they had already received the needed enchantment.",["atomIDs"]={"5538:description:1-60","5538:description:63-146","5538:description:149-245","5538:description:248-317","5538:description:322-352","5538:description:355-411","5538:description:416-460","5538:description:463-467","5538:description:472-492","5538:description:495-504","5538:objective:1-88"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5538:completion:1-61","5538:completion:63-128","5538:completion:133-165","5538:completion:167-178","5538:completion:180-257"},["opening"]="The alchemist's preparation now required a paid craftsman. Goodsteel's Gadgetzan workshop would receive the imbued fragments and a substantial fee to produce the mold.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the fragments and fifteen gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Arbington's materials and payment.",["sourceHash"]="7df14e39f465188278cc1668472031455293b707b3814219ca73a102e7431adb",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5541]={["atomIDs"]={"5541:description:1-54","5541:description:57-173","5541:description:178-183","5541:description:185-241","5541:description:244-326","5541:description:328-370","5541:description:375-426","5541:description:429-482","5541:objective:1-59"},["opening"]="Wendigo drove Rudge's courier from a camp near the Grizzled Den, where he left a crate of ammunition. Rumbleshot's shop supplied practicing riflemen and mortar teams and needed the lost crate brought through.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover Rumbleshot's Ammo and take it to Hegnar Rumbleshot.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the recovered Rumbleshot's Ammo to Hegnar Rumbleshot.",["sourceHash"]="238360dbddbda193eac40ad5db0635589c747167416f9633b8435c5a0253f196",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5542]={["aftermath"]="Tirion invited rest, food and talk of earlier days.",["atomIDs"]={"5542:description:1-68","5542:description:70-125","5542:description:130-181","5542:description:186-292","5542:objective:1-70","5542:objective:72-123"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5542:completion:1-14","5542:completion:16-20","5542:completion:22-26","5542:completion:28-65"},["opening"]="Tirion asked visitors to earn a place at his stead. Plaguehounds were the first nuisance he offered to exchange for a warm meal and conversation.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to confront the three kinds of plaguehound.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Tirion's hound assignment.",["sourceHash"]="d069f8c79d2675c408689b93759d59ab8898c8bb5fd99b0bead5942b193b195d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5543]={["aftermath"]="Tirion found the service uplifting after a long absence of such examples of decency.",["atomIDs"]={"5543:description:1-56","5543:description:58-300","5543:description:305-378","5543:description:380-457","5543:objective:1-49"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5543:completion:1-41","5543:completion:43-119","5543:completion:121-155"},["opening"]="Tirion counted corrupted wildlife among the region's dangers alongside Scourge and Crusade. The bats attacked from above, making the sky itself another source of threat.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront thirty plaguebats.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Tirion's bat assignment.",["sourceHash"]="2c01ebfa6940e0663b4884d5e95e19111f5c171accffe9638a0ed1f2ec8e2801",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5544]={["atomIDs"]={"5544:description:1-37","5544:description:39-112","5544:description:117-163","5544:description:165-264","5544:description:266-359","5544:description:361-428","5544:objective:1-55","5544:objective:57-89","5544:objective:91-169"},["opening"]="Winter required far more food than Tirion had stored. Carrion worms, which he considered untouched by the plague, offered bland meat that could be preserved for months.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gather fifteen slabs of worm meat.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} replenished Tirion's stores with the meat.",["sourceHash"]="29b331552c49cb21ba21b97eeda9d042c10ac86378468d8691e5d146f8dd1c83",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5545]={["aftermath"]="With the lumber recovered, Raelen expected to meet the order in time.",["atomIDs"]={"5545:description:1-36","5545:description:38-115","5545:description:117-233","5545:description:238-351","5545:description:353-432","5545:objective:1-63"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5545:completion:1-10","5545:completion:12-73","5545:completion:75-162","5545:completion:167-189"},["opening"]="Raelen's deadline was approaching while cut lumber remained beyond the workers' reach. Wolves and bears north of Eastvale had driven them away from wood they had already bundled; recovering it could still save the order.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather eight abandoned bundles for Supervisor Raelen.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the bundles to Raelen at Eastvale.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="cf6f7b96165dd1c428fd62ece39276aae4e588175642d0df308b4e68065935a7",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5561]={["aftermath"]="Smeed counted the five beasts and imagined the profits they would bring.",["atomIDs"]={"5561:description:1-76","5561:description:79-149","5561:description:152-310","5561:description:315-453","5561:description:456-503","5561:objective:1-101"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5561:completion:1-38","5561:completion:43-66","5561:completion:68-134","5561:completion:136-159","5561:completion:161-175","5561:completion:177-253"},["opening"]="Smeed's caravan partnership depended on rejuvenated kodos. His device could tame older beasts and make them follow a handler back to camp.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring back five tamed kodos and the device.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned five kodos and the kombobulator to Smeed.",["sourceHash"]="fd0ffb26e35564d8eb02e749a49fa71dacdda957ca89f86c57b9c777286abd32",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5581]={["atomIDs"]={"5581:description:1-28","5581:description:30-53","5581:description:58-137","5581:description:139-172","5581:description:174-277","5581:description:279-294","5581:description:296-331","5581:objective:1-86"},["opening"]="Taiga placed the demonic hand at the center of a counterattack. Its power was needed to banish the portals feeding demons into Mannoroc Coven.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to banish six portals for Taiga.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the portal assignment and returned to Shadowprey.",["sourceHash"]="b79a558245ab05af774173b13958f52bcb3a61ee860a140afd8c03b3650f41c8",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5582]={["aftermath"]="Betina considered it valuable to her continuing studies and asked for further specimens if any were found.",["atomIDs"]={"5582:description:1-53","5582:description:56-159","5582:description:164-217","5582:objective:1-102"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5582:completion:1-10","5582:completion:12-94","5582:completion:96-171"},["opening"]="One healthy scale stood out among the diseased scales of a plagued hatchling. Betina's research could use the unusual specimen.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the healthy scale to Betina.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Healthy Dragon Scale to Betina.",["sourceHash"]="af76ec80558cb13cc378a9f87415b47699d8403a153c86033f9b5fad8f1f6676",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5601]={["aftermath"]="Pamela remembered games and flowers with Jessica and hoped her sister's return might bring their father home too.",["atomIDs"]={"5601:description:1-147","5601:description:150-184","5601:description:187-247","5601:description:252-370","5601:description:373-415","5601:description:418-473","5601:description:478-501","5601:objective:1-35"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5601:completion:1-27","5601:completion:29-80","5601:completion:82-118","5601:completion:120-146","5601:completion:148-178","5601:completion:183-277","5601:completion:279-364","5601:completion:369-387","5601:completion:389-468"},["opening"]="Jessica escaped before the plague took her homeland but feared her family died at Darrowshire. Her request focused especially on the little sister left behind.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find Pamela for Jessica.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Pamela at Darrowshire.",["sourceHash"]="9b5e243e11ad720c60904cb4b069b446064f39ea4f84961f6a4db7073d77a686",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5621]={["aftermath"]="Laurna recognized the service to Elune and offered a robe marking a place within the order.",["atomIDs"]={"5621:description:1-21","5621:description:23-142","5621:description:144-198","5621:description:200-217","5621:description:222-300","5621:description:302-370","5621:description:372-426","5621:objective:1-67","5621:objective:69-163"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5621:completion:1-45","5621:completion:47-68","5621:completion:73-119","5621:completion:121-176","5621:completion:178-273","5621:completion:278-310"},["opening"]="Sentinel Shaya had been wounded while patrolling south of Dolanaar. Laurna had to remain with her students, so she sought healing and protective magic for the injured sentinel.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to heal Shaya with Lesser Heal and strengthen her with Fortitude.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Laurna after healing and fortifying Shaya.",["sourceHash"]="f6f2b00030915ece21f595bd25d627ddae533ae860c59e45abe41538b454ceb2",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5622]={["aftermath"]="Laurna welcomed Shanda's referral and the opportunity to teach.",["atomIDs"]={"5622:description:1-78","5622:description:80-120","5622:description:122-287","5622:description:292-344","5622:objective:1-43"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5622:completion:1-52","5622:completion:54-122"},["opening"]="Shanda directed the young priest toward Dolanaar. Laurna Morninglight would continue the teaching of Elune's ways and oversee the first garments marking that station.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Laurna in Dolanaar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Laurna Morninglight in Teldrassil.",["sourceHash"]="de63ffddca3a95089dfcee61199a1d96f14d312ca6187e4637094a5b01a28234",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5623]={["aftermath"]="Josetta welcomed the arrival and prepared to discuss the path ahead within the Light.",["atomIDs"]={"5623:description:1-39","5623:description:41-99","5623:description:101-214","5623:description:216-308","5623:description:310-348","5623:objective:1-44"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5623:completion:1-28","5623:completion:30-102"},["opening"]="Anetta judged that the time had come for further study beyond Northshire. Josetta in Goldshire had heard of the young priest's progress and was ready to continue the teaching.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to find Josetta in Goldshire.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Priestess Josetta in Elwynn.",["sourceHash"]="62265de16d6e4d18973b267b147ced1f37832b93a016a3d38a020ca915f9f834",["sourceRaceMask"]="1",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
