[5721]={["aftermath"]="Pamela heard her father's promise to come home and his instruction to welcome the visitor, then offered tea in thanks.",["atomIDs"]={"5721:description:1-87","5721:description:92-188","5721:description:191-358","5721:description:363-426","5721:description:429-479","5721:objective:1-54","5721:objective:59-116","5721:objective:121-188","5721:objective:193-221","5721:objective:226-336"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5721:completion:1-21","5721:completion:24-54","5721:completion:57-115","5721:completion:118-130","5721:completion:135-209","5721:completion:214-243"},["opening"]="Chromie's bundle could raise the battle's spirits for another chance at Joseph's fate. Davil had to outlast Horgus, while Joseph had to survive into corruption before being defeated and freed.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to preserve the required lives and free Joseph's spirit.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the battle's conditions and returned to Pamela.",["sourceHash"]="7d275444d71be12ab7f4d28ac2cfad50810eaf6f53bbb5744118b6fc4df53030",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5722]={["aftermath"]="The corpse bore heavy blows, while most clothing and equipment remained. The search turned toward anything that might explain his discovery.",["atomIDs"]={"5722:description:1-76","5722:description:78-227","5722:description:229-349","5722:description:354-448","5722:description:453-508","5722:objective:1-90"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5722:completion:1-119","5722:completion:121-184","5722:completion:189-266"},["opening"]="Magatha's servant Maur had vanished after finding something peculiar in Ragefire Chasm. Rahauro asked for his body to be found and searched for evidence of that discovery.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to locate Maur in Ragefire Chasm and search for clues.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Maur's body and examined it for items of interest.",["sourceHash"]="35b9ef28b43ac2b884ef28e14f08fca22cc5a579313f3389cba484750594e5e2",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5723]={["aftermath"]="Rahauro hoped the losses would hinder their ascent, while leaving their origins and purposes for future study.",["atomIDs"]={"5723:description:1-133","5723:description:135-255","5723:description:257-371","5723:description:376-467","5723:description:469-509","5723:objective:1-132"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5723:completion:1-51","5723:completion:53-66","5723:completion:68-171","5723:completion:176-286"},["opening"]="Rahauro reported that troggs beneath Orgrimmar had killed Magatha's diplomats. She now regarded them as a threat to the Horde and wanted their numbers reduced before more reached the surface.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to defeat eight Ragefire troggs and eight shamans.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the requested trogg and shaman defeats to Rahauro.",["sourceHash"]="d12ba482b319c54c0b36167ffed30cefd75bfdf763a642f6cff8c28fffb4e514",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5724]={["aftermath"]="Rahauro thanked the finder and passed on Magatha's promised acknowledgment.",["atomIDs"]={"5724:description:1-48","5724:description:50-162","5724:description:167-333","5724:objective:1-55"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5724:completion:1-14","5724:completion:16-25","5724:completion:30-120","5724:completion:122-147"},["opening"]="Maur's body still gripped a satchel as though protecting it during the attack. The recovered bag was to leave the tunnels and reach Rahauro in Thunder Bluff.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring Maur's satchel back to Rahauro.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro.",["sourceHash"]="31e5a1d041673d5b5c88183349124fd71b31cfb43135f3a35ef23208ade0cb19",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5725]={["aftermath"]="Varimathras praised the service and spoke of future work toward the Dark Lady's aims against the Lich King.",["atomIDs"]={"5725:description:1-81","5725:description:83-189","5725:description:191-204","5725:description:209-318","5725:description:320-479","5725:description:481-506","5725:objective:1-94"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5725:completion:1-9","5725:completion:11-54","5725:completion:56-140","5725:completion:142-174","5725:completion:176-322"},["opening"]="Varimathras wanted two powerful books held by the Searing Blade below Orgrimmar. He presented the seizure as service to the Dark Lady, who preferred the Legion's gifts in her own hands.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the two books and bring them to Varimathras.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the shadow and nether spellbooks to Varimathras.",["sourceHash"]="200c05365e45c911de0b9837124d75287bb12a464aec84efb4e3f841e964ee21",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5726]={["aftermath"]="Thrall welcomed a useful beginning while warning that far greater trials remained.",["atomIDs"]={"5726:description:1-60","5726:description:62-214","5726:description:219-285","5726:description:287-310","5726:description:312-349","5726:description:354-508","5726:objective:1-53"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5726:completion:1-9","5726:completion:11-105","5726:completion:107-191","5726:completion:193-235","5726:completion:237-332","5726:completion:337-376","5726:completion:378-448","5726:completion:450-474"},["opening"]="Thrall wanted the corruption's source rather than a premature blow that drove it deeper. A young agent could enter places his known servants could not, beginning with an insignia from Skull Rock.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover a lieutenant's insignia.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the insignia to Thrall.",["sourceHash"]="2adef08248c0c01707c1b8d31319bd42bcdca398d7c8754b01103e4da26b242e",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5727]={["aftermath"]="Thrall treated the result as the first foundation for a broader attack and asked for every word of the exchange.",["atomIDs"]={"5727:description:1-62","5727:description:67-130","5727:description:132-192","5727:description:194-239","5727:description:241-342","5727:description:347-497","5727:objective:1-67","5727:objective:69-166"},["bridge"]="The insignia was meant to carry an agent into Neeru's confidence. Thrall already knew where the warlock's loyalties lay, but wanted that hidden allegiance used against the network around him.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"5727:description:1-62","5727:description:67-130","5727:description:132-192","5727:description:194-239","5727:description:241-342","5727:description:347-497","5727:objective:1-67","5727:objective:69-166"},["bridgeFrom"]=5726,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="7a5b987b9c75b9adb2e5d30b525ac01bbeb1c48668ecd1a08272da8ecb456297",["endingAtomIDs"]={"5727:completion:1-10","5727:completion:12-30","5727:completion:35-206","5727:completion:211-232","5727:completion:234-303"},["opening"]="Thrall said he knew Neeru's true allegiance and intended to use it. The recovered badge could test whether the warlock would accept an apparent member of the cult.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to test the insignia's deception and return.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the audience to Thrall.",["sourceHash"]="7a5b987b9c75b9adb2e5d30b525ac01bbeb1c48668ecd1a08272da8ecb456297",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5728]={["aftermath"]="Thrall had heard of disorder in the caverns and Neeru's agitation. He regarded the result as a small but welcome victory.",["atomIDs"]={"5728:description:1-36","5728:description:38-59","5728:description:61-140","5728:description:142-154","5728:description:156-235","5728:description:240-298","5728:description:300-358","5728:description:360-420","5728:description:422-493","5728:objective:1-78"},["bridge"]="What Thrall learned through Neeru drew the next strike toward Bazzalan and Jergosh. The Searing Blade leaders were targets whose defeat had to leave the agent's cover intact.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"5728:description:1-36","5728:description:38-59","5728:description:61-140","5728:description:142-154","5728:description:156-235","5728:description:240-298","5728:description:300-358","5728:description:360-420","5728:description:422-493","5728:objective:1-78"},["bridgeFrom"]=5727,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="b6c1e931a94e1951d3640ba834fe8307397f5cc49fe61c96ae4066d2468b60dc",["endingAtomIDs"]={"5728:completion:1-30","5728:completion:32-171","5728:completion:173-227","5728:completion:229-267","5728:completion:269-297","5728:completion:299-329"},["opening"]="Thrall targeted the Searing Blade leaders valued by Neeru. Bazzalan and Jergosh had to be removed without exposing the infiltrator's assumed place among Neeru's allies.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to defeat Bazzalan and Jergosh while preserving the cover Thrall required.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the defeat of both Searing Blade leaders to Thrall.",["sourceHash"]="b6c1e931a94e1951d3640ba834fe8307397f5cc49fe61c96ae4066d2468b60dc",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5729]={["aftermath"]="Neeru revealed anger over the deaths of Bazzalan and Jergosh and blamed Thrall's agents for disrupting his plans.",["atomIDs"]={"5729:description:1-66","5729:description:68-142","5729:description:144-328","5729:description:330-437","5729:description:442-509","5729:objective:1-38"},["bridge"]="Reports of Neeru's agitation suggested another opening. Thrall wanted the agent placed closer to him, hoping the turmoil would yield either more knowledge or the warlock's confidence.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"5729:description:1-66","5729:description:68-142","5729:description:144-328","5729:description:330-437","5729:description:442-509","5729:objective:1-38"},["bridgeFrom"]=5728,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="8b8184f0d0eacbf50d4e4e57d293d4b5198c48afaac235e65aeda5d26326308b",["endingAtomIDs"]={"5729:completion:1-12","5729:completion:14-27","5729:completion:29-41","5729:completion:43-86","5729:completion:88-118","5729:completion:120-230","5729:completion:232-326","5729:completion:328-403"},["opening"]="Thrall sought a place close to the agitated warlock. An apparent recruit might learn more and gain responsibility while the cult's leadership was unsettled.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with Neeru discreetly.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to the warlock.",["sourceHash"]="8b8184f0d0eacbf50d4e4e57d293d4b5198c48afaac235e65aeda5d26326308b",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5730]={["aftermath"]="Thrall ordered investigation of the previously unknown Ashenvale presence and allowed the agent to rest.",["atomIDs"]={"5730:description:1-30","5730:description:32-52","5730:description:54-79","5730:description:84-224","5730:description:226-292","5730:description:294-393","5730:description:395-412","5730:objective:1-62"},["bridge"]="Neeru's new orders stretched beyond the trouble in Ragefire. He intended other agents to begin work in the Barrens and Ashenvale, and that wider agenda was news Thrall needed to hear.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"5730:description:1-30","5730:description:32-52","5730:description:54-79","5730:description:84-224","5730:description:226-292","5730:description:294-393","5730:description:395-412","5730:objective:1-62"},["bridgeFrom"]=5729,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="4983fafd069a4a805f6262655d2c2081acff45daf007226d82e211ca27f36f50",["endingAtomIDs"]={"5730:completion:1-10","5730:completion:12-97","5730:completion:99-128","5730:completion:130-148","5730:completion:153-211","5730:completion:213-244","5730:completion:249-261"},["opening"]="Neeru accepted the visitor as a lieutenant and spoke of agents in the Barrens and Ashenvale. His plans outside the damaged chasm supplied information intended for Thrall rather than an honest promise of service to the cult.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to report the new plans.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} told Thrall what had been learned.",["sourceHash"]="4983fafd069a4a805f6262655d2c2081acff45daf007226d82e211ca27f36f50",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5741]={["atomIDs"]={"5741:description:1-117","5741:description:119-199","5741:description:201-260","5741:description:265-316","5741:description:319-423","5741:objective:1-91"},["opening"]="Azore feared a relic rumored to have passed from naga to the Burning Blade. Legends credited it with sinking cities, making its recovery urgent in his eyes.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the sceptre from the watchtower seer.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Sceptre of Light to Azore.",["sourceHash"]="63a54de4adf1efe2ad2604acdc16b2a9cc89a8c9c6d3150c9f6904d9c6db3bc3",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5742]={["atomIDs"]={"5742:description:1-29","5742:description:31-94","5742:objective:1-42"},["opening"]="Tirion invited rest after the work around his stead. He was ready to introduce himself properly before explaining the difficult task of the family's redemption.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to listen to Tirion's account.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} heard Tirion's story.",["sourceHash"]="697ddaa0a4cf87cf78547c469cb5d789dd43baba8ff23d8ce3b3aa751a90e501",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5761]={["aftermath"]="Neeru promised to deal with the heart and tell Thrall of the success.",["atomIDs"]={"5761:description:1-151","5761:description:153-339","5761:description:344-443","5761:description:448-509","5761:objective:1-112"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5761:completion:5-19","5761:completion:21-46","5761:completion:51-101","5761:completion:106-153","5761:completion:155-191","5761:completion:196-222"},["opening"]="Neeru claimed the task of rooting demonic influence from Orgrimmar. He named Taragaman as a Searing Blade leader and wanted the felguard's heart as proof for Thrall.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to defeat Taragaman and bring his heart to Neeru.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned Taragaman's heart to Neeru.",["sourceHash"]="202ea01277acadb8cdd77f112c744431d088b6e1124adb3c39f503b5c641d898",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5762]={["aftermath"]="Hemet identified its contents as special-gauge ammunition for the jungle expedition.",["atomIDs"]={"5762:description:1-77","5762:description:80-142","5762:description:145-268","5762:description:275-362","5762:description:371-409","5762:description:414-474","5762:objective:1-57"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5762:completion:1-33","5762:completion:35-47","5762:completion:49-133","5762:completion:138-203","5762:completion:205-236"},["opening"]="Hemet's delayed package reached Kravel after its customer had left to hunt in Stranglethorn. Keeping relations with a wealthy patron made onward delivery worthwhile.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to carry Kravel's crate to Hemet.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the crate in Stranglethorn.",["sourceHash"]="599eec23684de97fb6dbadb8de2e26730060545939134aeccd76d057a7c91b75",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5763]={["aftermath"]="Hemet remembered Roon fondly and considered a future Desolace expedition, without committing to a return.",["atomIDs"]={"5763:description:1-36","5763:description:39-92","5763:description:95-174","5763:description:177-226","5763:description:231-333","5763:description:336-352","5763:description:357-395","5763:description:398-424","5763:description:427-494","5763:objective:1-60"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5763:completion:1-49","5763:completion:51-106","5763:completion:108-142","5763:completion:147-205","5763:completion:207-289"},["opening"]="Roon remembered hunting alongside Hemet despite their peoples' enmity. A kodo horn would carry an invitation to renew that companionship in Desolace.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take Roon's gift to Hemet.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the horn and invitation.",["sourceHash"]="88afd1b0466e39787969d625231e3fc115aa6d85545e4dfd021f4775cc14ea27",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5781]={["aftermath"]="Tirion struggled to hold back tears and welcomed the kindness behind the recovery.",["atomIDs"]={"5781:description:1-76","5781:description:81-148","5781:description:150-243","5781:description:248-317","5781:description:319-426","5781:description:431-493","5781:objective:1-112","5781:objective:114-173"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5781:completion:1-35","5781:completion:40-71","5781:completion:73-111"},["opening"]="Taelan's childhood hammer was buried at a false grave after he was told his banished father had died. Tirion wanted that beloved toy recovered as the first reminder of the past his son had lost.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover the small hammer from the Undercroft.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned Taelan's hammer to Tirion.",["sourceHash"]="ef3aa0bb09208932143be71a304b6710ce6a9631fe329b248068e59eb7ea279a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5801]={["aftermath"]="Arbington explained that the key was still unfinished. Araj the Summoner in Andorhal was the next source of power required to focus it.",["atomIDs"]={"5801:description:1-84","5801:description:87-151","5801:description:156-227","5801:description:230-298","5801:description:301-423","5801:description:428-447","5801:description:450-508","5801:objective:1-95","5801:objective:98-177","5801:objective:182-278"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5801:completion:1-59","5801:completion:61-150","5801:completion:152-258","5801:completion:260-317","5801:completion:322-430"},["opening"]="Krinkle's mold could fuse thorium and bone, but only a powerful heat source would do. Fire Plume Ridge's lava lake offered the forge before the unfinished key returned to Arbington at Chillwind Point.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to forge the Unfinished Skeleton Key with the mold and two Thorium Bars, then take it to Arbington.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Fire Plume forging and delivered the Unfinished Skeleton Key to Alchemist Arbington.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="63bcfc427ee1593863bd93d52e6904c061a48e537f85e156e594d463acf09fa5",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5802]={["aftermath"]="Dithers identified Araj the Summoner as the next obstacle. The forged key still needed a focus before it could serve its purpose.",["atomIDs"]={"5802:description:1-84","5802:description:87-151","5802:description:156-227","5802:description:230-298","5802:description:301-423","5802:description:428-447","5802:description:450-506","5802:objective:1-95","5802:objective:98-177","5802:objective:182-273"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5802:completion:1-59","5802:completion:61-150","5802:completion:152-258","5802:completion:260-317","5802:completion:322-430"},["opening"]="The key stem needed heat beyond an ordinary workshop. Krinkle directed the mold and two Thorium Bars to Fire Plume Ridge, with the fused but unfinished result due back to Dithers at the Bulwark.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to forge the Unfinished Skeleton Key at Fire Plume Ridge and return it to Dithers.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the forging assignment and delivered the Unfinished Skeleton Key to Apothecary Dithers.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="373b5326a500a6bb0422ff6b95a61fd22838ed7c3d7912d0e14fbc1ad6349f11",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5803]={["aftermath"]="The alchemist prepared a solvent to attach it to the key and infuse the power needed for the door.",["atomIDs"]={"5803:description:1-67","5803:description:70-158","5803:description:161-254","5803:description:259-366","5803:description:369-428","5803:description:433-466","5803:objective:1-113"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5803:completion:1-16","5803:completion:23-93","5803:completion:95-180","5803:completion:185-227","5803:completion:229-397","5803:completion:402-434"},["opening"]="Arbington identified Araj as Scholomance's former leader and current lord of Andorhal. The scarab in his phylactery could supply the signet required to make the forged key function.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover Araj's scarab.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the scarab to Arbington.",["sourceHash"]="bd46bbbf3bff0fa8447ede47ac5d551087a6c69cd13d874a7e307c5e16d037ca",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}
}
